#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the gate and readout noise for the 49-qubit checked-Ising circuit {#learn-the-gate-and-readout-noise-for-the-49-qubit-checked-ising-circuit}"
msgstr "Pelajari noise gate dan readout untuk circuit checked-Ising 49-qubit {#learn-the-gate-and-readout-noise-for-the-49-qubit-checked-ising-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To mitigate the noise, we must model how the noise is affecting our entangling gates. Here we learn a Pauli-Lindblad noise model for each of the circuit's three unique entangling layers using [qiskit-noise-learning](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-noise-learning). Later, we will prune this noise model of error generators that are detectable by the symmetry checks and mitigate only the remaining noise channel with PEC. The map below shows the three learned layers on the QPU; each qubit is a wheel of its weight-1 X/Y/Z rates, and each coupler a 3×3 grid of the weight-2 Pauli rates on that pair. The $\\gamma$ value of $10$ implies a sampling overhead of $\\gamma^2=10^2=100$.\n"
msgstr "Untuk memitigasi noise, kita harus memodelkan bagaimana noise memengaruhi gate entangling kita. Di sini kita mempelajari model noise Pauli-Lindblad untuk masing-masing dari tiga lapisan entangling unik circuit menggunakan [qiskit-noise-learning](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-noise-learning). Nantinya, kita akan memangkas model noise ini dari generator kesalahan yang dapat dideteksi oleh pemeriksaan simetri dan hanya memitigasi kanal noise yang tersisa dengan PEC. Peta di bawah menunjukkan tiga lapisan yang dipelajari pada QPU; setiap qubit adalah roda dari laju bobot-1 X/Y/Z-nya, dan setiap coupler adalah grid 3×3 dari laju Pauli bobot-2 pada pasangan tersebut. Nilai $\\gamma$ sebesar $10$ menyiratkan overhead sampling sebesar $\\gamma^2=10^2=100$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The readout (TREX) corrections come directly from the SPAM paths of the noise-learning fit. The stem plot below the QPU noise map shows the per-observable TREX rescale factors.\n"
msgstr "Koreksi readout (TREX) berasal langsung dari jalur SPAM dari fit pembelajaran noise. Plot stem di bawah peta noise QPU menunjukkan faktor rescale TREX per-observable.\n"

